  "question": "A small ball of mass $2$ g and charge $+5\\ \\mu$C hangs from a thread in a uniform horizontal electric field. In equilibrium the thread makes $45°$ with the vertical. Find the field strength in N/C. ($g = 10\\ \\text{m/s}^2$)",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [],
  "answer": "",
  "numerical_answer": "4000",
  "tolerance": "0",
  "solution": "$\\tan 45° = \\dfrac{qE}{mg} \\Rightarrow E = \\dfrac{mg}{q} = \\dfrac{2 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 10}{5 \\times 10^{-6}} = 4000$ N/C.",
